sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(238,248,242) GUI thread only, the worker is driven by a timer
        participant V as ImageViewerWidget<br/>(passive view)
        participant W as ImageWindow<br/>(wiring)
        participant C as ImageController
        participant P as ImageProcessingWorker<br/>(timer driven)
        participant A as ActiveContour
    end

    Note over W,P: Commands: from the window to the algorithm

    W->>C: open an image, apply settings
    C->>P: initialize(image, config)
    Note over C,P: preprocessing (filters) runs here, synchronously:<br/>the interface waits until it is done
    W->>C: start (or step, pause, converge)
    C->>P: restart()

    Note over P,V: Each timer tick runs a short time slice

    loop until the contour is stable
        P->>A: runCycles(...) within the time slice
        P-->>C: contourUpdated(contours)
        P-->>C: processedImageReady(image)
        C->>C: build the point layers (presentation)
        C-->>V: contourUpdated(layers)
        Note over C,V: connected by ImageWindow
        P-->>C: diagnosticsUpdated(diagnostics)
    end

    P-->>C: stateChanged(converged)
    C-->>W: state shown in the interface
